 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nBayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG                              MASTER SERVICES\nHauptstraße 42, 50667 Köln, Germany                                     AGREEMENT\nUSt-IdNr: DE821714420\n\nVON                                                         RECHNUNGSADRESSE\nBayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG                          Schwarzwald Medizintechnik AG\nHauptstraße 42                                              Berliner Allee 19\n50667 Köln                                                  50667 Köln\nGermany                                                     Germany\nVAT: DE821714420\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 05.03.2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Bayerische\nWerkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG, with its registered office at Hauptstraße 42, Köln (\"Party A\"), and Schwarzwald Medizintechnik AG, with its\nregistered office at Berliner Allee 19, Köln (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Bayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG / Hans Schneider\nParty B      Schwarzwald Medizintechnik AG / Anna Weber\nDate         05.03.2026",
